  "s-rules": {
   "x": 4480,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 520,
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "x-shift",
   "text": "Console rules: desktop first (248 px sidebar, grouped; Setup, Insights and Admin fold unless open). Each role sees only its items (ux-admin 1.5). Top bar: search ( / ), SOS indicator (red with count when open, hidden for verification and finance), bell, Approvals (finance and super admin). Lists: filters, saved views, export (logged), 50 rows, live with a \"new\" pill instead of reshuffling. Every money, status or access change opens a dialog with the effect in one sentence, a required reason, and a second approval when it applies. Staff see phone numbers; opening ID images is logged."
  },
  "s-in": {
   "x": 4480,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 520,
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "x-in",
   "text": "Staff sign-in follows D044, stricter: email code on first sign-in, a 6-digit PIN, then two-step sign-in is REQUIRED (authenticator + 10 backup codes). Later: email + PIN + authenticator code; sessions last 12 h. 5 wrong authenticator codes lock two-step sign-in until an email code (X00j). Google sign-in is off. A two-step reset needs a second super admin."
  },
  "s-wa": {
   "x": 4480,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 520,
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "x-people",
   "text": "WhatsApp is off for now, so the support inbox shows email, in-app help and the contact form. When WhatsApp is connected, it joins the same list with the 24-hour reply window countdown, and outside the window only approved templates can be sent."
  }
 },
